WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 1, Scene 29h: Galbadian mech soldier assault on Balamb Garden
Duration: ~46 seconds
Source: FF8 FMV — Battle of the Gardens paratrooper sequence

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A Galbadian transport ship looms overhead, red hull against blue sky.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Inside the cargo bay, rows of mech suits hang from the ceiling.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Mechs drop from the ship's underside into open air.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Dark cockpit interior. A soldier prepares for deployment.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Close-up of an armored soldier, green scarf, helmet with red sensors, number zero-eight.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Mech soldiers fly on jetpacks over rocky mountains and green fields.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Soldiers in mech suits breach Garden's curved outer ring corridor.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A soldier rappels down Garden's teal hull, rifle ready, mountains behind.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Two soldiers descend on cables down the massive wall.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.100
A soldier crashes through a classroom. Debris flies.
